        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Regency Road, Adelaide; Klemzig; Dudley Park, South Australia; Kilkenny; Broadview\n- Organizations: Arndale Shopping Centre; City of Port Adelaide Enfield\n- Roads and transport: Muller Road; North East Road; Simpson Avenue; Harrison Road; Adelaide-Gawler railway line\n\nFacts:\n- Regency Road in Adelaide is located about 6 km north of the city centre.\n- Regency Road spans from Arndale Shopping Centre in Kilkenny in the west to Broadview in the east.\n- Regency Road continues eastwards as Muller Road and ends at North East Road in Klemzig.\n- Klemzig is a suburb of Adelaide in the City of Port Adelaide Enfield.\n- Dudley Park is bordered to the north by Regency Road, to the south by Simpson Avenue, to the east by the Adelaide-Gawler railway line, and to the west by a line running north-south from the Harrison Road-Simpson Avenue intersection to Regency Road.",
